{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d4bdd64f-d5a2-89f3-912b-a0a21eae1c30",
  "created_at": "2026-02-05T11:46:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Alan Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:44:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:44:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I'm calling about trash. My landlord left a bunch of stuff out on the curb after a tenant moved out. A mattress, a couple of chairs, some bags. It's been sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:44:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. What's the address where it's sitting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:44:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "108 Marsh Street. Down in the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "108 Marsh Street, in the Point. And you said a mattress, chairs, and some bags, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Mattress, two chairs, maybe four or five bags. Some of it's already split open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And is it your place, or is this the landlord's pile?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent upstairs. The pile's from the other unit. Landlord put it out and left."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So you're a tenant at 108 and the landlord set out the bulk items. What I can tell you is that bulk items usually have to be handled separately from the regular trash, so it may not go with the normal pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Figured. So when's the next pickup? For that street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:45-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at Marsh Street. [pause] Okay, your regular trash day is Monday, so the next one would be this coming Monday. Recycling is on the alternate weeks, so I'd want to confirm which week that falls on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:45:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday. Okay. And the mattress, will they take it Monday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not necessarily. I'll put in a request for a crew to look at the bulk items so it's on record. Can I get a name and a number in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alan Gifford. 401-555-0196."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alan Gifford, 401-555-0196, 108 Marsh Street, bulk waste left at the curb after a move-out. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. The request goes to the crew supervisor, and somebody should call you back or stop by in the next few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I've got to go, I'm heading to a union meeting after this. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:46:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Alan. Thanks for calling."
    }
  ],
